# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Left out: Daily Delivery (469).
# Givers passed at Menethil and left for the 27-29 Wetlands visit (06-wetlands), by design: Reclaiming
# Goods and Apprentice's Duties (281, 471): their work is the hovels and north-coast loop that visit
# makes anyway for The Cursed Crew, so taking them at 24 would add a trip; Uncovering the Past (299,
# level 27, 2.6-3.3 over at the dig), From the Ashes and Raene's Cleansing (98221, 1026: levels 27-28).
# The Third Fleet (288, a mead from the same inn) is done on the first Menethil stop, and The Cursed Crew (289)
# taken there for the next visit (fix round 2026-11-20).
# Hand-cut 2026-11-07 (the Alliance 21-24 level hole): the 20-24 part of the old 25-29 guide,
# played right after Darkshore; the 27-29 Wetlands, Ironforge and Stormwind quests are in
# 06-wetlands, after Duskwood. Ashenvale's first visit (fix round 2026-11-20): Astranaar and Elune's Tear,
# then one sweep up the west (the Ruins of Stardust, Ilkrud, Therysil, Teronis, Maestra's Post, the Zoram
# Strand) and the hearth back to Astranaar, then Stonetalon (Windshear Crag, the Pridewings and the courier
# on the way north to Stonetalon Peak) and the Peak's flight back to Astranaar, then the south-east
# (the Foulweald, the Gleaming Crescent Pendant, Mystral Lake) and Dal Bloodclaw north of town, at about 24-25
# with the Foulweald's 24-25 furbolgs, Mystral Lake's 23-25 elementals and Dal (25) at most one level over.
# Raene's Cleansing (1024, the walk to Shael'dryn in the Howling Vale) is taken on 06-wetlands' first
# Astranaar stop: its next part (1026) is Shael'dryn's, on that visit's way east.
# Group quest: Gerenzo's Orders (1090, `when group 1090`, #1370): Piznik's five-minute defence in the Windshear
# Mine (quest level 22) was lost solo at 23 and 25 in players' recordings; grouped players finished it from 23.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkshore

step Kerlonian Evershade
  skipto ashenvale when !onquest 945,967,968,990,98461
  zone Darkshore
  tip Back north from the glaive (Druids: south along the road from Auberdine) to the Grove of the Ancients, where Kerlonian sleeps beside Arbal. Take his quest: it gives you the Horn of Awakening. Use the horn to wake him and lead him south along the road to his bag at the southern edge of Darkshore; blow it again whenever he falls asleep. Then go on to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post.
  tip Careful: Scripted ambushes of three mobs each attack along the road.
  accept 5321                                 -- Kerlonian Evershade
  goto 44.4,76.4 "Kerlonian Evershade"
  complete 5321 @41.6,89.9
  note Escort Kerlonian south along the road to his bag at the southern edge of Darkshore, then go on to Liladris at Maestra's Post.

