# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The west: the Ruins of Stardust, Ilkrud, the lake, the Zoram Strand

step The Ruins of Stardust
  zone Ashenvale
  tip South-west from Astranaar: west of Mystral Lake, the stardust bushes grow among the ruins.
  tip Careful: Shadethicket Raincallers and Wood Shapers (22–24) stand among the bushes. Clear one bush at a time; don’t run through the camp.
  goto 33.3,67.7 "The Ruins of Stardust"
  collect 5494 quest 1034 @33.3,67.7      -- Handful of Stardust

step Ilkrud Magthrull
  tip From the Ruins of Stardust head north-west to the Fire Scar Shrine and go in from the east side: Ilkrud and his guards hold a hill inside it. Pull his guards first.
  collect 5533 quest 973                  -- Ilkrud Magthrull's Tome

