# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North to Stonetalon Peak

step Night Elf Courier
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip West from the Webwinder Path along the road, past the Pridewing slopes: the courier waits by the road on their west side. His supplies drop from the Pridewings, and Innkeeper Faralia at Stonetalon Peak, at the end of the road north, takes them.
  accept 86574                            -- Night Elf Courier

step The Pridewings
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip Pridewing Wyverns (21-22) and Consorts (22-23) nest on the slopes either side of the road, Skyhunters (23-24) a little further north-east. Any of them drops the venom sacs and the courier's supplies: start with the Consorts right beside the courier and work back along the road.
  tip Careful: Sorrow Wing, a rare elite wyvern (27), flies over the Pridewing slopes and the road north: leave it alone.
  collect 5808 quest 1134 @49.0,40.3      -- Pridewing Venom Sac
  collect 277917 quest 86574              -- Stonetalon Supply Bundle

step Stonetalon Peak
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip North along the road to Stonetalon Peak: Keeper Albagorm stands by the flight master, Innkeeper Faralia in the inn just west of them.
  getfp "Stonetalon Peak"
  turnin 1056                             -- Keeper Albagorm
  turnin 86574                            -- Innkeeper Faralia, in the inn

