# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south-east, then Dal Bloodclaw

step The Foulweald
  tip South-east from Astranaar, south of the road: the Foulweald furbolgs live in the woods. The Den Watcher and the Ursas guard the den at its north-west corner.
  tip Careful: The Den Watcher and the Ursas (24-25) stand together at the den: pull them one at a time.
  kill 3746 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Den Watcher
  kill 3749 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Ursa
  kill 3750 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Totemic
  kill 3743 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Warrior

step Gleaming Crescent Pendant
  tip South-east of the Foulweald, the Gleaming Crescent Pendant lies in the grass: Maliynn, in Astranaar's inn, takes it.
  tip Careful: two Shadethicket Bark Rippers (26-27) stand within a few steps of it: pull them one at a time before you pick it up.
  accept 98027 object 669176          -- Gleaming Crescent Pendant: for Maliynn in Astranaar

step Mystral Lake
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Sentinel Velene Starstrike stands at the Silverwind Refuge on the east shore of Mystral Lake. Befouled Water Elementals (23-25) wade in the lake.
  tip Careful: Tideress, a level 27 water elemental, walks the lake's west shore among them: leave it be.
  accept 1016                             -- Sentinel Velene Starstrike
  collect 12220 x5 optional           -- Underwater
  collect 5455 quest 1016 @49.6,71.3      -- Kill the elementals for 5 Intact Elemental Bracers, then use the Divining Scroll
  turnin 1016

step Dal Bloodclaw
  tip North from Mystral Lake, past Astranaar's east side, to the Thistlefur camp: Dal Bloodclaw leads the furbolgs there. Then south to Astranaar.
  tip Careful: Dal is level 25, and the furbolgs near him usually join in when he is pulled. Kill the ones along his path first so you fight him alone.
  collect 5544 quest 1054                 -- Dal Bloodclaw's Skull

step Astranaar
