# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Bluegill Marsh

step Bluegill Marsh
  tip Follow the coast north out of Menethil. Bluegill Murlocs fill the marsh; Gobbler walks with a pack in the middle of it.
  kill 1024 quest 279                     -- Bluegill Murloc
  collect 3618 quest 279                  -- Gobbler's Head

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East Wetlands

step Young crocolisks
  tip From the marsh head east across the Wetlands. Young Wetlands Crocolisks lurk in the pools north of the excavation site.
  collect 3397 quest 484                  -- Young Crocolisk Skin

step Whelgar's Excavation Site
  tip The excavation site sits on the hill south of the road.
  turnin 305                              -- Merrin Rockweaver, below ground
  accept 306
  accept 294                              -- Ormer Ironbraid

step The raptor hills
  tip Mottled Raptors and Screechers roam the hills west of the excavation site.
  tip Careful: Once a Mottled Screecher drops to 30% health, it calls for help from creatures within 20 yd. Mottled Screechers frequently come in packs of three, and raptors summoned by their calls for help may also join the fight.
  kill 1021 quest 294                     -- Mottled Screecher; careful: Nightveiled Rotheap, a level 31 elite, roams these hills
  kill 1020 quest 294                     -- Mottled Raptor

step Ormer Ironbraid
  turnin 294
  accept 295                              -- Ormer Ironbraid: the bigger raptors in the valley west of the dig are for your next Wetlands visit, at about 29

step The Green Belt
  tip Einar Stonegrip camps by the road; Rethiel the Greenwarden stands farther east, by the river.
  turnin 463                              -- Rethiel the Greenwarden
  accept 276

step Thelgen Rock
  tip Cave Stalkers and Leech Stalkers fill Thelgen Rock, the cave south-east of the excavation site. Careful: Highland Lurkers and Horrors, level 28 elites, walk the same cave among them: pull the stalkers one at a time and keep clear of the elites.
  collect 280319 quest 98282              -- Unruptured Stalker Gland

step The Mosshide gnolls
  tip Mosshide Gnolls and Mongrels hold the hills south-east of the Green Belt.
  kill 1007 quest 276                     -- Mosshide Gnoll
  kill 1008 quest 276                     -- Mosshide Mongrel

step Rethiel the Greenwarden
  turnin 276
  accept 277                              -- Its flint comes from the Mosshide Fenrunners on the way to Ironbeard's Tomb; Rethiel takes it on your next Wetlands visit

step Ironbeard's Tomb
  zone Wetlands
  tip North-west from Rethiel: the Mosshide Fenrunners and Trappers (22-24) along the river south-west of Ironbeard's Tomb drop flint, almost every one. Black, Crimson and Monstrous Oozes fill Ironbeard's Tomb, just west of the road to Dun Modr and north of Einar's camp. Careful: Black and Crimson Oozes also drop Sida's Bag. Pull those instead of fighting the larger Monstrous Oozes (25–26).
  tip Careful: Maddened Rotclaws (25-26) roam the Green Belt around Rethiel and north of him: cross it to the river and don't hunt the flint there. Mosshide Brutes, Mystics and Alphas (24-27) hold the hills north-west of the Fenrunners' camp.
  loop
  goto 45.34,32.49 map 1437 era
  goto 43.56,34.58 map 1437 era
  collect 2611 quest 277 -- Crude Flint: the Mosshide Fenrunners and Trappers by the river
